  id: fortunate
  displayName: Fortunate
  description: 'The Prince favours whoever is wearing this, right now -- a flat,
    passive bonus to Prince''s Favor for as long as it stays equipped, nothing stored
    and nothing that outlives taking it off. Base 3 at Ordinary/tier-0 sits alongside
    Shawn''s own authored favour of 4: a meaningful nudge toward better drops, not
    a second currency to bank.'
